---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service - SwasthaTrack"
  description="Terms of service and platform software license agreement for the SwasthaTrack hospital operations system."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-sm space-y-8">
      
      <div class="border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 pb-6">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400">Governance & Agreement</span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-1">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-2">Last Updated: August 2026 • Production Edition</p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        <section class="space-y-2">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
          <p>
            By accessing or operating the SwasthaTrack healthcare multi-department platform, medical practitioners, hospital staff, administrators, and patients agree to be bound by these Terms of Service and applicable ABDM digital healthcare protocols.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-2">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">2. Clinical Decision Support Disclaimer</h2>
          <p>
            SwasthaTrack's AI triage engine provides algorithmic queue urgency scoring and triage recommendations. It is intended solely as an operational clinical decision support tool and does not substitute for the licensed diagnostic judgment of certified medical doctors.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-2">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">3. Role-Based Access & Security</h2>
          <p>
            Authorized users must maintain the confidentiality of their credentials and role authorization keys. Any unauthorized attempt to tamper with inter-departmental API routing or patient records will result in immediate termination of system access and regulatory notification.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-2">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">4. System Availability & Service Level Agreement</h2>
          <p>
            SwasthaTrack is engineered for 99.9% uptime with dual-node resilience. In the event of network connectivity interruptions, local offline fallback caches maintain uninterrupted clinical triage operations.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
